<LegalLayout title="Terms of Use" description="The terms that apply when you use our website, author portal and publishing services." updated="18 August 2026">
  <p>These terms apply when you use the Chance Publishers website, register for our author portal, or engage us for publishing services. By using our site or portal, or by paying for our services, you agree to these terms.</p>

  <h2>Our services</h2>
  <p>Chance Publishers provides book publishing support in Kenya, including manuscript editing, proofreading, interior layout, cover design, ISBN facilitation through the Kenya National Library Service, printing guidance, author branding and book launch support. Exact deliverables and pricing for your project are set out in your chosen publishing package (Bronze, Silver or Gold) or in a written quotation.</p>

