  <h2>The publishing process</h2>
  <p>Before we can review or work on your manuscript, you must:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Choose a publishing package and start a project through the author portal.</li>
    <li>Complete and sign our Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) and pay the applicable NDA processing fee.</li>
    <li>Pay the required deposit on your chosen publishing package (see our <a href="/legal/payment-policy">Payment Policy</a>).</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Once these steps are complete, your manuscript moves through admin review, editing, proofreading, interior layout, cover design and final approval, in that order. You will be notified — by email, SMS or WhatsApp, and inside the portal — at each stage that needs your input or approval.</p>

