    <li>You are responsible for the accuracy of the content in your manuscript. Editing and proofreading services improve grammar, structure and presentation — they do not verify facts, claims or legal compliance of your content.</li>
    <li>You agree to respond to review and approval requests in a reasonably timely manner, since delays on your side will delay your book's production timeline.</li>
